  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Program R&#xe5;dgivare DACU</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme Adviser DACU</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det serbiska ministeriet f&#xf6;r utrikes ekonomisk samverkan har inkommit med en f&#xf6;rfr&#xe5;gan om Sida kan st&#xf6;dja ministeriet med en r&#xe5;dgivare f&#xf6;r projekt beredning till ministeriets enhet f&#xf6;r koordination av bist&#xe5;nd. Sida har genomf&#xf6;rt en upphandling och SIPUs kandidat Bj&#xf6;rn Tore Carlsson var den mest kvlitativa ans&#xf6;kan som inkom.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Serbian Ministry of International Economic Relations MIER have requested Sida to finance and engage a Programme Preparation Adviser to the Development Aid Co-ordination Unit in order to provide support in programme and project preparations. Sida invited qualified agencies to tender and Mr Bj&#xf6;rn Tore Carlsson SIPU was most qualified</narrative>
  </description>
